 *
 * I2C bus : /dev/i2c-1  (BCM pins 2 = SDA, 3 = SCL)
 * Sensor  : LSM303D at 0x1D (SA0 tied high)
 * INT1    : GPIO23 (BCM 23, physical pin 16)
